{'symbol': 'ED', 'date': '2021-11-18 14:39:00', 'title': 'CON EDISON NAMES TIMOTHY CAWLEY CHAIRMAN OF THE BOARD', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NOV. 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CONSOLIDATED EDISON, INC. (CON EDISON) (NYSE:ED) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS ELECTED TIM CAWLEY, 56, AS CHAIRMAN OF THE BOARD. CAWLEY BECAME PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AT THE BEGINNING OF THIS YEAR AFTER JOHN MCAVOY RETIRED.'}{'symbol': 'ED', 'date': '2021-11-18 09:00:00', 'title': 'CON EDISON WINS 2021 RELIABILITYONE® AWARDS FOR RELIABLE SERVICE, DEDICATION TO PUBLIC SAFETY', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NOV. 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CON EDISON\xa0WON RECOGNITION FROM PA CONSULTING AS THE RECIPIENT OF THE 2021 RELIABILITYONE® AWARD FOR OUTSTANDING RELIABILITY PERFORMANCE IN THE NORTHEAST METROPOLITAN SERVICE AREA. THE COMPANY IS ALSO A RECIPIENT OF THE RELIABILITYONE® OUTSTANDING COMMUNITY SAFETY AWARD.'}